{"ts":"2026-07-25T07:12:45.393Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T07:12:45.393Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-25T07:12:45.389Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Duplicate-check evidence (all-status pm search over SDK surface, entrypoint, subpath, exports, tiering, import cost): matched closed pm-xzhz, pm-rjqr, pm-ju83, pm-ds3b, pm-9x6e, pm-8778, pm-79fr, pm-16ue and open pm-usfg, pm-e6tm5c, pm-92if. The closed set is promotion work (moving capability INTO the SDK) and boundary work (stopping private-core imports OUT of CLI/MCP); pm-e6tm5c is the snapshot/change gate over whatever shape exists. Nothing owns the partitioning of the surface or its import cost. Filed as a child of pm-usfg."}]}],"before_hash":"7161e879c3a7c564d13841a5e04d06546f108e9e5f9dcc1708ebe999d164792a","after_hash":"a3b54ea5f2c7e1d6e9fe9e186b42a3128c480cfe70544e19471cc3fdc09f3e7a"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T07:12:46.149Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T07:12:46.141Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Surface measurement: Object.keys on the published sdk entry yields 881 exports (693 functions, 188 values). src/sdk/index.ts is 35 'export *' lines, so any new module file joins the public surface with no review step. package.json exports declares four subpaths only ('.', './sdk', './sdk/runtime', './sdk/testing'); dist/sdk/index.d.ts carries 102 top-level export statements. Import cost measured against a 41ms bare-node baseline: sdk.js 289ms, main.js 286ms — importing one SDK primitive costs the same as launching the whole CLI. Contract constants (ACTIVITY_COMMANDER_STRING_OPTION_CONTRACTS, CALENDAR_FLAG_CONTRACTS, CONTEXT_FLAG_CONTRACTS and siblings) sit in the same namespace as authoring primitives with no marker distinguishing them."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T07:12:46.149Z"}],"before_hash":"a3b54ea5f2c7e1d6e9fe9e186b42a3128c480cfe70544e19471cc3fdc09f3e7a","after_hash":"ccb0446c992cc4028b33e1979df6257b81fe237295c2c2a07acee24f4ccb15ab"}
